  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "做伙來唸詩 - 柚仔，m̄-thang háu"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"color: #333333; font-family: &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: black; font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px; text-align: center;\">柚仔，m̄-thang háu</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0px;\">/ ogo</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj5WMlayZeKhHmp3yZBUE8uRifAllvkK2qWKcQ4kr_gyTnp-TZ1mQC59IImdyph2_WQXdM6Rpa1QAOkh4SYgAkIlxtuJPIA1Xga8v9ZrN3nSeUmZpvBZCplTimmjl50JTXhbQvV-4D26WFOD597xxZ6tymHWue3TTDUypyK0kUtsdfQps1Bftkqe-urNbr2\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 0px 10px; text-align: justify;\"><b><i>\n        送hō͘拍桌球ê『柚子同學』kah所有勇敢ê台灣人<br /></i></b><br />柚仔　m̄-thang háu<br />柚仔　m̄-thang háu<br /><br />Lán是山海ê子民<br />有山ê堅定<br />有海ê氣魄<br /><br />天搖地動是笑m̄驚<br />風颱大水也心頭定<br />   <br />Lán是山海ê子民<br />Koân山徛tī lán ê kha-chiah-phiaⁿ<br />跋倒失志也chhāi正正<br />大海hō͘ lán ê眼界闊<br />沖天海湧是lán ê笑聲<br /><br />堅定<br />自信<br />主心定<br /><br />M̄免驚　m̄免驚<br />Lán有山海做靠山<br /><br />M̄-thang háu　m̄-thang háu<br />目屎拭ta　繼續走<br /><br />柚仔　m̄-thang háu<br />柚仔　m̄-thang háu<br />\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tg-annotations\" style=\"border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; color: #666666; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 60px; padding: 15px 10px 0px;\">編註：2025年7--月世大運桌球男團決賽，台灣隊kah中國隊sio戰。擔任主將ê高承睿（偏名『柚子同學』，chit首詩kā叫做「柚仔」）tī決賽承擔chiâⁿ大ê壓力，hō͘對手用計「針對」連sòa失兩點。比賽結束了後，高承睿自責，為著án-ne喉tīⁿ目屎流。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); margin-top: 40px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjNiVwx6-77-SDULgj3q_bfHrUo3_Roo6-fMTHVqrNFfDeL-o1vio8JNE9ttAr4juuoLBCoqWQ6-5qs_iB9pGdVTb4Fx16bMNui_feJU0V7T55gpISpW383Hs1sXfZ08leSSo0pL1xgP9W9oImlsdNIowsKpQE18TyjKLQL8Z02EqrK7mCeBuIDefeAxh60\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 388期，2026年07月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br />\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br />\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
  },
